From 4f52f344a20c663b7eb46be82f171c1cc777a857 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vince8x <vince.tran8x@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Aug 2024 20:43:03 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] Update ticker from XEC to DOGE and adjust decimals (#38)

- Removed legacy icon files (pre-bch-icon.png, pre-ecash-icon.png).
- Changed all instances of the ticker symbol from 'XEC' to 'DOGE' in the views.
- Updated the decimals calculation to reflect DOGE (100000000 SATS per DOGE instead of 100 as XEC).
- Cleaned up code by removing unused variables related to XEC.

Original-Commit: 717a1e877768875c577aff7ed0199c53c2e4efc8
Adaptation: Preserve modern token views, renamed txsRender.js and optional Avalanche finality UI; port DOGE denominations and remove inapplicable BCH/XEC historical markers. Extend denomination correction to the newer faucet view. Existing address encoding is unchanged; native Dogecoin address UI support remains a separate compatibility limitation.

diff --git a/web/explorer/explorer-server/assets/pre-bch-icon.png b/web/explorer/explorer-server/assets/pre-bch-icon.png
deleted file mode 100644
